Package: xfwl4
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wayland compositor for Xfce4
 xfwl4 is a Wayland compositor for Xfce4 built on Smithay/wlroots.
 Provides both winit (nested) and TTY (udev+egl) backends.
